{"id":"9cfebb2fc4b84c8f","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-pde.md","title":"Partial Differential Equation","display":"df-pde — Partial Differential Equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pde","aliases":["58-df-pde","Partial Differential Equation"],"display":"df-pde — Partial Differential Equation","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pde"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pde</span><span>Partial Differential Equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pde — Partial Differential Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md\">../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,q,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n,q,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in C^m(\\Omega,\\mathbb R^q)\">\\(u\\in C^m(\\Omega,\\mathbb R^q)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in(\\mathbb R^r)^{(\\mathbb R^q)^{n^{\\leq m}}}\">\\(\\Phi\\in(\\mathbb R^r)^{(\\mathbb R^q)^{n^{\\leq m}}}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,u,\\Omega,n,q,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,u,\\Omega,n,q,m)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md\">../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PDE}_S(\\Phi,u;\\Omega,n,q,m,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{PDE}_S(\\Phi,u;\\Omega,n,q,m,r)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinearPDE}_S(L,u,f;\\Omega,n,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{LinearPDE}_S(L,u,f;\\Omega,n,m)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pde} \\vdash \\operatorname{PDE}_S(\\Phi,u;\\Omega,n,q,m,r) \\leftrightarrow n,q,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land m\\in\\omega\\land u\\in C^m(\\Omega,\\mathbb R^q)\\land\\Phi\\in(\\mathbb R^r)^{(\\mathbb R^q)^{n^{\\leq m}}}\\land\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,u,\\Omega,n,q,m)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(\\langle F(s)(x)\\mid s\\in n^{\\leq m}\\rangle)=0_{\\mathbb R^r}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pde} \\vdash \\operatorname{PDE}_S(\\Phi,u;\\Omega,n,q,m,r) \\leftrightarrow n,q,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land m\\in\\omega\\land u\\in C^m(\\Omega,\\mathbb R^q)\\land\\Phi\\in(\\mathbb R^r)^{(\\mathbb R^q)^{n^{\\leq m}}}\\land\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,u,\\Omega,n,q,m)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(\\langle F(s)(x)\\mid s\\in n^{\\leq m}\\rangle)=0_{\\mathbb R^r}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pde\\text{-}linear} \\vdash \\operatorname{LinearPDE}_S(L,u,f;\\Omega,n,m) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\\land u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land L(u)=f\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pde\\text{-}linear} \\vdash \\operatorname{LinearPDE}_S(L,u,f;\\Omega,n,m) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\\land u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land L(u)=f\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The nonlinear differential expression receives the finite word-indexed derivative tower from the smooth-function definition; no undeclared jet primitive is used.</li>\n<li>The linear case reuses the exact differential-operator signature and states <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(u)=f\">\\(L(u)=f\\)</span> as an equality of functions.</li>\n<li>Elliptic/Hyperbolic/Parabolic: classification by eigenvalues of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^{ij}\">\\(a^{ij}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Green's function: fundamental solution</li>\n<li>Weak solution: in Sobolev space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}\">\\(W^{k,p}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Evans, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Taylor, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u\\in C^m(\\Omega,\\mathbb R^q)$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,u,\\Omega,n,q,m)$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n,q,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in C^m(\\Omega,\\mathbb R^q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\in(\\mathbb R^r)^{(\\mathbb R^q)^{n^{\\leq m}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,u,\\Omega,n,q,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PDE}_S(\\Phi,u;\\Omega,n,q,m,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LinearPDE}_S(L,u,f;\\Omega,n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pde} \\vdash \\operatorname{PDE}_S(\\Phi,u;\\Omega,n,q,m,r) \\leftrightarrow n,q,r\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land m\\in\\omega\\land u\\in C^m(\\Omega,\\mathbb R^q)\\land\\Phi\\in(\\mathbb R^r)^{(\\mathbb R^q)^{n^{\\leq m}}}\\land\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,u,\\Omega,n,q,m)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(\\Phi(\\langle F(s)(x)\\mid s\\in n^{\\leq m}\\rangle)=0_{\\mathbb R^r}\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pde\\text{-}linear} \\vdash \\operatorname{LinearPDE}_S(L,u,f;\\Omega,n,m) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(L,\\Omega,n,m)\\land u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land f\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land L(u)=f","display":true},{"tex":"L(u)=f","display":false},{"tex":"a^{ij}","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}","display":false}],"bytes":2034,"backlinks":[{"id":"355f225c96e5595e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-951","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-pde.md|58-df-pde]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["17de8347f6f91384","76305a7e4d824323"]}